	(text "irq_pending input to conditional is to be used\nwith halt instruction to check if ints are pending.\nit is also used with the cpu trace mode so that when coming out of the trace microcode loop,\nwe can jump to the interrupts handler if interrupts are pending. without the irq_pending\nconditional it is impossible to execute interrupts when executing in trace mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
