	(text "to calculate of when doing shifts we first save the sign\nof the original number, then when done shifting\nwe save the value of the result. then we do a xor\nof both values, and the result is the of.\nthe result of the xor is the msb of the result\n(zbus7). this is why wehave zbus7 as one of the inputs\nto of\nanother possibility is to first save the sf into\nthe u-flags register before doing the shifts,\nthen with each shift, save the of by\ndoing a xor of the original sf saved in the usf\nwith the new sf coming from the alu. if they differ\nthen of = 1. this saves about one clocm cycle at the\nend."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 698.5 2122.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.5113)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39660218-df40-4233-8379-fdadc905aa45")
	)
